@host = http://localhost:5247

# Built from configured editions/raids and static World Data; no upstream WCL calls.
# This endpoint has no route parameters, query parameters or request body.
# It does not require edition: one response contains all configured editions.
# Response: 200 with editions and instances grouped by edition slug.
# Boss entries include id, name, slug and mapped; unmapped bosses retain their names.

### Complete configured raid catalog
GET {{host}}/api/raid-catalog
Accept: application/json
